1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,046
On energy profiles the difference is clear.

2
00:00:03,046 --> 00:00:08,763
S N two has one hump, a single transition state, no intermediate.

3
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:11,770
S N one has two humps with a well between them.

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:16,640
That well is the carbocation, a real, if short lived, species.

